{
  "description": "raster-mask outside mode under terrain, drawn after a semi-transparent line in the same draped proxy tile. The line's stencil pass inverts stencil values, which sets the reserved mask bit, and must be reset before the raster draws; the raster must still cover the line everywhere outside the mask (right half), with no line-shaped holes.",
